# Firebase Web SDK config for the `signin-online` project. These values
# are not secret (Firebase's own docs confirm this — they're visible in
# any browser's network tab / bundled JS regardless), and committing
# them is what keeps every build — anyone's machine, any time — using
# the correct values. Two real production bugs already came from a
# gitignored .env.local silently diverging from what should have been
# checked in: an emulator-only flag that leaked into a production
# build, and authDomain pointing at signin-online.firebaseapp.com
# instead of signin-online.web.app (breaks signInWithRedirect on
# Safari 16.1+ / Firefox 109+, which block the cross-origin storage
# access that flow needs when authDomain differs from the app's own
# domain — see https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/web/redirect-best-practices).
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyBEUAX7-30EPoeuuZYXgrJQCPrlpKod1Q8
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=signin-online.web.app
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=signin-online
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=signin-online.firebasestorage.app
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=718143139110
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:718143139110:web:779db1583931c696bf65e7
